  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 7c7c947f0ccabb24dbf991df8e9f6d4f, type: 3}
  m_Name: curriculum hr sec TE
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  defaultQuestions:
  - QuestionText: According to NCFTE-2009, what is the primary vision for higher
      secondary teacher education?
    Options:
    - To produce teachers focused solely on completing the syllabus
    - To develop subject specialists with research orientation and reflective capabilities
    - To train teachers exclusively for administrative roles
    - To focus only on examination preparation techniques
    CorrectOptionIndex: 1
    LevelName: curriculum hr sec TE
  - QuestionText: 'The curriculum structure for higher secondary teacher education
      emphasizes developing teachers who can:'
    Options:
    - Work only with homogeneous student groups
    - Avoid dealing with diverse learning needs
    - Focus solely on textbook content delivery
    - Facilitate critical thinking and independent learning among students
    CorrectOptionIndex: 3
    LevelName: curriculum hr sec TE
  - QuestionText: How does the 'Engagement with the Field' component in higher secondary
      teacher education differ from elementary level?
    Options:
    - It is completely eliminated
    - It focuses more on advanced subject-specific pedagogical research
    - It involves only classroom observation
    - It is shorter in duration
    CorrectOptionIndex: 1
    LevelName: curriculum hr sec TE
  - QuestionText: 'The ''Vision'' of higher secondary teacher education particularly
      emphasizes preparing teachers for:'
    Options:
    - Foundational literacy and numeracy
    - Pre-primary education
    - Only administrative responsibilities
    - The specific cognitive and developmental needs of young adults
    CorrectOptionIndex: 3
    LevelName: curriculum hr sec TE
  - QuestionText: Which of the following is a key component of the curriculum structure
      for higher secondary teacher education?
    Options:
    - Basic child psychology only
    - Advanced pedagogical content knowledge in specialized subjects
    - Only classroom management techniques
    - Exclusive focus on co-curricular activities
    CorrectOptionIndex: 1
    LevelName: curriculum hr sec TE
  - QuestionText: 'The ''Internship'' in higher secondary teacher education program
      typically includes:'
    Options:
    - Only elementary level teaching
    - Only community service
    - Only administrative work
    - Teaching senior secondary classes and conducting action research
    CorrectOptionIndex: 3
    LevelName: curriculum hr sec TE
  - QuestionText: 'The ''Perspectives in Education'' component for higher secondary
      teachers includes deeper engagement with:'
    Options:
    - Only psychological perspectives
    - Philosophical, sociological, and political economy perspectives of education
    - Only management studies
    - Only technological aspects
    CorrectOptionIndex: 1
    LevelName: curriculum hr sec TE
  - QuestionText: What is the primary focus of 'Curriculum and Pedagogic Studies'
      at higher secondary level?
    Options:
    - General teaching methods applicable to all subjects
    - Specialized pedagogy for advanced subject teaching
    - Only content knowledge enhancement
    - Only examination techniques
    CorrectOptionIndex: 1
    LevelName: curriculum hr sec TE
  - QuestionText: 'The ''Vision'' of higher secondary teacher education as per curriculum
      documents emphasizes developing teachers as:'
    Options:
    - Passive implementers of prescribed curriculum
    - Only classroom managers
    - Critical scholars and curriculum developers in their subjects
    - Isolated subject experts
    CorrectOptionIndex: 2
    LevelName: curriculum hr sec TE
  - QuestionText: 'The ''Assessment and Evaluation'' component for higher secondary
      teachers focuses on:'
    Options:
    - Only traditional examination methods
    - Developing capabilities for designing sophisticated assessment tools
    - Only continuous comprehensive evaluation
    - Eliminating all forms of assessment
    CorrectOptionIndex: 1
    LevelName: curriculum hr sec TE
  - QuestionText: 'The ''Research Perspective'' in higher secondary teacher education
      curriculum aims to develop:'
    Options:
    - Only theoretical research knowledge
    - Only library research skills
    - Only statistical analysis skills
    - The ability to conduct subject-specific educational research
    CorrectOptionIndex: 3
    LevelName: curriculum hr sec TE
  - QuestionText: How does the structure of higher secondary teacher education address
      the need for 'subject specialization'?
    Options:
    - By eliminating pedagogical components
    - Through deep engagement with subject-specific pedagogical content knowledge
    - By focusing only on general education principles
    - By reducing practical components
    CorrectOptionIndex: 1
    LevelName: curriculum hr sec TE
  - QuestionText: 'The ''ICT Integration'' in higher secondary teacher education
      emphasizes:'
    Options:
    - Basic computer literacy
    - Only programming skills
    - Using technology for advanced subject teaching and research
    - Eliminating traditional teaching methods
    CorrectOptionIndex: 2
    LevelName: curriculum hr sec TE
  - QuestionText: 'The ''School Internship'' for higher secondary teacher education
      typically requires engagement with:'
    Options:
    - Only primary classes
    - Classes XI-XII and involvement in academic counseling
    - Only administrative duties
    - Only co-curricular activities
    CorrectOptionIndex: 1
    LevelName: curriculum hr sec TE
  - QuestionText: 'The ''Vision'' of higher secondary teacher education particularly
      emphasizes preparing teachers who can:'
    Options:
    - Work only with average students
    - Focus only on completing syllabus
    - Mentor students in specialized subject areas and research projects
    - Avoid dealing with critical thinking skills
    CorrectOptionIndex: 2
    LevelName: curriculum hr sec TE
  - QuestionText: 'The ''Curriculum Studies'' component for higher secondary teachers
      focuses on:'
    Options:
    - Only national curriculum frameworks
    - Critical analysis of subject-specific curriculum frameworks
    - Only state-level curricula
    - Only historical curriculum documents
    CorrectOptionIndex: 1
    LevelName: curriculum hr sec TE
  - QuestionText: 'The ''Pedagogical Content Knowledge'' for higher secondary teachers
      requires:'
    Options:
    - Only advanced content knowledge
    - Only classroom management techniques
    - Only general teaching methods
    - Integration of specialized content knowledge with pedagogical strategies
    CorrectOptionIndex: 3
    LevelName: curriculum hr sec TE
  - QuestionText: 'The ''Understanding the Learner'' component at higher secondary
      level focuses on:'
    Options:
    - Only child development aspects
    - Adolescent psychology and young adult learning characteristics
    - Only physical development
    - Only social development
    CorrectOptionIndex: 1
    LevelName: curriculum hr sec TE
  - QuestionText: 'The ''Action Research'' component in higher secondary teacher
      education emphasizes:'
    Options:
    - Only theoretical research
    - Only statistical analysis
    - Subject-specific classroom-based research
    - Only library research
    CorrectOptionIndex: 2
    LevelName: curriculum hr sec TE
  - QuestionText: 'The ''Vision'' of higher secondary teacher education expects teachers
      to be:'
    Options:
    - Only content deliverers
    - Facilitators of critical inquiry and independent learning
    - Only examination evaluators
    - Isolated professionals
    CorrectOptionIndex: 1
    LevelName: curriculum hr sec TE
  - QuestionText: 'The ''Professional Development'' component for higher secondary
      teachers includes:'
    Options:
    - One-time training only
    - Continuous engagement with subject-specific professional communities
    - Only initial teacher training
    - Only administrative training
    CorrectOptionIndex: 1
    LevelName: curriculum hr sec TE
  - QuestionText: 'The ''Assessment Literacy'' for higher secondary teachers involves:'
    Options:
    - Only paper-pencil test construction
    - Only summative assessment
    - Only continuous evaluation
    - Designing diverse assessment tools for complex learning outcomes
    CorrectOptionIndex: 3
    LevelName: curriculum hr sec TE
  - QuestionText: 'The ''Curriculum and Pedagogic Studies'' for higher secondary
      teachers typically requires:'
    Options:
    - Pedagogy of one school subject only
    - Deep engagement with one or two specialized teaching subjects
    - Pedagogy of all school subjects
    - Only general education courses
    CorrectOptionIndex: 1
    LevelName: curriculum hr sec TE
  - QuestionText: 'The ''Vision'' of higher secondary teacher education emphasizes
      developing teachers'' capacity for:'
    Options:
    - Blind implementation of prescribed methods
    - Critical curriculum interpretation and adaptation
    - Only content mastery
    - Only classroom management
    CorrectOptionIndex: 1
    LevelName: curriculum hr sec TE
  - QuestionText: 'The ''School Experience Program'' for higher secondary teacher
      education includes:'
    Options:
    - Only classroom observation
    - Only administrative work
    - Engagement with senior secondary academic processes and counseling
    - Only community service
    CorrectOptionIndex: 2
    LevelName: curriculum hr sec TE
  - QuestionText: 'The ''Subject Knowledge Enhancement'' component for higher secondary
      teachers focuses on:'
    Options:
    - Basic subject concepts only
    - Advanced subject knowledge and emerging trends
    - Only pedagogical aspects
    - Only examination content
    CorrectOptionIndex: 1
    LevelName: curriculum hr sec TE
  - QuestionText: 'The ''Educational Technology'' component for higher secondary
      teachers emphasizes:'
    Options:
    - Basic computer operations
    - Only software programming
    - Only hardware maintenance
    - Technology integration for advanced subject teaching
    CorrectOptionIndex: 3
    LevelName: curriculum hr sec TE
  - QuestionText: 'The ''Vision'' of higher secondary teacher education particularly
      values teachers as:'
    Options:
    - Isolated technicians
    - Intellectual leaders and subject mentors
    - Only syllabus completers
    - Only discipline maintainers
    CorrectOptionIndex: 1
    LevelName: curriculum hr sec TE
  - QuestionText: 'The ''Research Methodology'' component in higher secondary teacher
      education aims to develop:'
    Options:
    - Only theoretical understanding
    - Only statistical skills
    - Capabilities for educational research in specialized subjects
    - Only library research skills
    CorrectOptionIndex: 2
    LevelName: curriculum hr sec TE
  - QuestionText: 'The ''Internship Evaluation'' for higher secondary teacher education
      focuses on:'
    Options:
    - Only teaching skills
    - Comprehensive professional capabilities including subject expertise
    - Only theoretical knowledge
    - Only communication skills
    CorrectOptionIndex: 1
    LevelName: curriculum hr sec TE
  - QuestionText: 'The ''Curriculum Development'' component for higher secondary
      teachers emphasizes:'
    Options:
    - Only implementation of prescribed curriculum
    - Only state-level curricula
    - Only national curriculum frameworks
    - Critical understanding and development of subject curricula
    CorrectOptionIndex: 3
    LevelName: curriculum hr sec TE
  - QuestionText: 'The ''Vision'' of higher secondary teacher education expects teachers
      to foster:'
    Options:
    - Rote learning and memorization
    - Critical thinking and research orientation among students
    - Only examination skills
    - Only co-curricular achievements
    CorrectOptionIndex: 1
    LevelName: curriculum hr sec TE
  - QuestionText: 'The ''Subject-Specific Pedagogy'' for higher secondary teachers
      requires:'
    Options:
    - Only content knowledge
    - Only general teaching methods
    - Integration of advanced content with specialized teaching strategies
    - Only classroom management
    CorrectOptionIndex: 2
    LevelName: curriculum hr sec TE
  - QuestionText: 'The ''Professional Ethics'' component for higher secondary teachers
      includes:'
    Options:
    - Only general ethical principles
    - Ethical dimensions of subject teaching and academic leadership
    - Only administrative ethics
    - Only personal morality
    CorrectOptionIndex: 1
    LevelName: curriculum hr sec TE
  - QuestionText: 'The ''Academic Counseling'' component in higher secondary teacher
      education prepares teachers for:'
    Options:
    - Only classroom teaching
    - Guiding students in subject choices and career planning
    - Only administrative counseling
    - Only personal counseling
    CorrectOptionIndex: 1
    LevelName: curriculum hr sec TE
  - QuestionText: 'The ''Vision'' of higher secondary teacher education emphasizes
      developing teachers who can:'
    Options:
    - Work in isolation from academic communities
    - Avoid professional development
    - Focus only on classroom teaching
    - Contribute to subject-specific academic discourse
    CorrectOptionIndex: 3
    LevelName: curriculum hr sec TE
  - QuestionText: 'The ''Assessment Design'' for higher secondary teachers focuses
      on:'
    Options:
    - Only recall-based questions
    - Developing higher-order thinking assessment tools
    - Only objective-type questions
    - Only practical examinations
    CorrectOptionIndex: 1
    LevelName: curriculum hr sec TE
  - QuestionText: 'The ''Curriculum Transaction'' for higher secondary teachers emphasizes:'
    Options:
    - Only lecture method
    - Innovative strategies for complex concept teaching
    - Only textbook reading
    - Only group activities
    CorrectOptionIndex: 1
    LevelName: curriculum hr sec TE
  - QuestionText: 'The ''Research Project'' component in higher secondary teacher
      education typically involves:'
    Options:
    - Only theoretical review
    - Only statistical analysis
    - Subject-specific educational research
    - Only library work
    CorrectOptionIndex: 2
    LevelName: curriculum hr sec TE
  - QuestionText: 'The ''Vision'' of higher secondary teacher education values teachers
      as:'
    Options:
    - Passive implementers
    - Active curriculum developers and critical practitioners
    - Only syllabus completers
    - Only examination evaluators
    CorrectOptionIndex: 1
    LevelName: curriculum hr sec TE
  - QuestionText: 'The ''Professional Communication'' for higher secondary teachers
      includes:'
    Options:
    - Only basic communication skills
    - Only administrative communication
    - Only classroom instructions
    - Advanced academic communication in specialized subjects
    CorrectOptionIndex: 3
    LevelName: curriculum hr sec TE
  - QuestionText: 'The ''Learning Resources Development'' for higher secondary teachers
      focuses on:'
    Options:
    - Only textbook usage
    - Creating advanced subject-specific learning materials
    - Only chalkboard use
    - Only ready-made materials
    CorrectOptionIndex: 1
    LevelName: curriculum hr sec TE
  - QuestionText: 'The ''Vision'' of higher secondary teacher education emphasizes
      preparing teachers for:'
    Options:
    - Only current classroom needs
    - Only administrative requirements
    - Only examination patterns
    - Future academic challenges and changing knowledge paradigms
    CorrectOptionIndex: 3
    LevelName: curriculum hr sec TE
  - QuestionText: 'The ''Subject Integration'' component for higher secondary teachers
      addresses:'
    Options:
    - Strict subject boundaries
    - Interdisciplinary connections and applications
    - Only single subject focus
    - Only theoretical aspects
    CorrectOptionIndex: 1
    LevelName: curriculum hr sec TE
  - QuestionText: 'The ''Academic Leadership'' component in higher secondary teacher
      education prepares teachers for:'
    Options:
    - Only classroom teaching
    - Leading subject departments and academic initiatives
    - Only administrative leadership
    - Only personal development
    CorrectOptionIndex: 1
    LevelName: curriculum hr sec TE
  - QuestionText: 'The ''Vision'' of higher secondary teacher education particularly
      emphasizes:'
    Options:
    - Standardized teaching approaches
    - Only traditional methods
    - Innovation and creativity in subject teaching
    - Only examination preparation
    CorrectOptionIndex: 2
    LevelName: curriculum hr sec TE
  - QuestionText: 'The ''Evaluation Techniques'' for higher secondary teachers include:'
    Options:
    - Only written examinations
    - Multiple methods for assessing complex learning
    - Only practical tests
    - Only viva voce
    CorrectOptionIndex: 1
    LevelName: curriculum hr sec TE
  - QuestionText: 'The ''Professional Development'' for higher secondary teachers
      emphasizes:'
    Options:
    - One-time training
    - Only initial qualification
    - Continuous engagement with subject academic communities
    - Only administrative training
    CorrectOptionIndex: 2
    LevelName: curriculum hr sec TE
  - QuestionText: 'The ''Curriculum Innovation'' component for higher secondary teachers
      focuses on:'
    Options:
    - Only prescribed curriculum implementation
    - Developing innovative approaches to subject teaching
    - Only traditional methods
    - Only textbook content
    CorrectOptionIndex: 1
    LevelName: curriculum hr sec TE
  - QuestionText: 'The ''Vision'' of higher secondary teacher education ultimately
      aims to develop teachers who can:'
    Options:
    - Maintain status quo in education
    - Work in isolation from educational developments
    - Focus only on examination results
    - Transform higher secondary education through academic excellence
    CorrectOptionIndex: 3
    LevelName: curriculum hr sec TE
